---
const { companyOrigin = "", compact = false } = Astro.props;
---
<footer class:list={{compact}}>
  <div class="top"><strong>마이너스베타스튜디오</strong><nav aria-label="하단 안내"><a href={`${companyOrigin}/`}>홈</a><a href={`${companyOrigin}/organization/`}>회사 정보</a><a href={`${companyOrigin}/#projects`}>프로젝트</a></nav></div>
  <details open={!compact}><summary>사업자 정보</summary><div class="business"><span>대표 강대종</span><span>호스팅 서비스 제공자 Cloudflare, Inc.</span><span>사업자등록번호 878-21-02478</span><span>통신판매업 신고 제2026-서울마포-1177호</span><span>주소 서울특별시 마포구 만리재로10길 4 (공덕동)</span><span>전화 <a href="tel:01074842927">010-7484-2927</a></span><span>이메일 <a href="mailto:minusbetastudio@gmail.com">minusbetastudio@gmail.com</a></span></div></details>
  <p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} 마이너스베타스튜디오</p>
</footer>
<style>
/* Colors: light literals as var() fallbacks; dark values come from tokens.css. Width follows --page-max (T-261011-068). */
footer{width:min(var(--page-max,1000px),calc(100% - 64px));margin:auto;border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding:28px 0 36px;color:var(--fg-dim);font-size:12px;line-height:1.8}.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;margin-bottom:16px}.top strong{font-weight:550;color:var(--fg)}nav{display:flex;gap:20px}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;padding-block:11px;margin-block:-11px}a:hover{text-decoration:underline}a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:4px}.business{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px 20px}.business span{overflow-wrap:anywhere}p{font-size:11px;margin:16px 0 0;color:var(--fg-mute)}@media(max-width:650px){footer{width:calc(100% - 40px)}.top{flex-direction:column;gap:12px}.business{display:grid;font-size:11px}}
summary{cursor:pointer;min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center}summary::after{content:" +";margin-left:8px}.compact{width:min(var(--page-max,1000px),calc(100% - 64px));color:var(--text-2);border-color:var(--border)}.compact .top{align-items:center}.compact details .business{padding:8px 0}.compact .top strong{color:var(--fg)}.compact p{color:var(--text-2)}@media(max-width:600px){.compact{width:calc(100% - 40px)}.compact .top{align-items:flex-start}}
</style>
